        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova. Utanjili muŋanda yadilwe. Utainki kuyoolila nikuba kubaomokela, nkaambo bantu aba ndabanyanzya luumuno lwangu abuuya bwangu aluzyalo lwangu, mbwaamba Jehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.5",
