        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova wamakamu Leza wa-Israyeli, Ncobeni mpoonya ano, kumeso aanu amumazuba nimucipona, njoolesya ijwi lyabusekelezi ajwi lyakukondwa, ijwi lyasibwiinga ajwi lyanabwiinga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.16.9",
