          "text": "Kuyooambwa kuti, Jehova mbwali muumi, iwakagwisya bana ba-Israyeli mucisi cakunyika amuzisi zyoonse nkwaakabatandide, Nkaambo njoobaboozya kunyika eyo njiyonya njindakapa bamawisaabo.",
