        },
        {
          "text": "Amubone! Ndaita basikuzuba banji, mbwaamba Jehova, kuti bazoobazube, Alimwi musule lyayaaya njootuma kuyooita bavwimi banji, kuti bazoobavwime koonse koonse kuzilundu akutulundulundu amumampangala aakumandomba. ",
